    "MediaPipe is default; OpenCV ONNX is an opt-in alternative, not an automatically active replacement.",
    "Metric reconstruction requires camera-specific intrinsic calibration at the exact uploaded image resolution; T-pose alone does not supply measured scale.",
    "RTMPose COCO-17 cannot fill all 33 MediaPipe slots; absent joints remain invalid.",
    "A stable depth estimate is not necessarily an accurate one. No real-camera angle accuracy or end-to-end latency guarantee is established.",
